    "note": "Introduced version; no votes on file. SECTION 2 (ORS 166.262) also changes the rule that bars arrest or charge of a licence holder, so the Capitol carve-out no longer applies to legislators and staff (the text has a struck comma in that clause, so it is not quoted)."
