  "operative_text": "SECTION 1 (ORS 166.370): Members of the Legislative Assembly who are licensed under ORS 166.291 and 166.292 to carry a concealed handgun, and legislative branch employees who are licensed under ORS 166.291 and 166.292 to carry a concealed handgun, qualify for the affirmative defense described in subsection (3)(g) of this section concerning the possession of a firearm within the Capitol."
